<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe ambulance crash kills nine people.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe ambulance crash kills nine people.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine people were killed and several injured on Wednesday when an ambulance collided with another vehicle in Zimbabwe's midlands district of Zvishavane, state radio reported.</p>
